# The ASR runtime assets are pinned by SHA-256 in the model manifests
# (gigaam_v3_spm.tsv is the GigaAM hotword tokenizer). Never convert their
# line endings: with core.autocrlf=true a Windows checkout turned the .tsv
# into CRLF, its hash stopped matching, and GigaAM refused to load.
native/asr-runtime/assets/* -text
